          "settings": {
            "quote": "Received the covers yesterday and they are wonderful. Thank you for all of your help. \nAs a retired band director, I appreciate your fast service and the ability to order less than 10. \nHopefully we can work together with another cash strapped program in the future. Again, we really appreciate you.",
